==================================================
PIPELINE SHAPE TRANSITION CONCEPT ANCHOR
==================================================
Raw PIL Image:   (H, W, C)      <- Height, Width, Channels (Standard Image)
ToTensor:        (C, H, W)      <- Channels first (Required by PyTorch)
Batch Tensor:    (B, C, H, W)   <- Batch size appended at dimension 0
==================================================

--- TRANSFORM DIMENSION SHIFT FLOW ---
PIL Original Image: (225, 225, 3) (Height, Width, Channels)
 -> Resized Image:  (518, 518, 3) (H, W, C)
 -> Tensor Output:  torch.Size([3, 518, 518]) (Channels, Height, Width) [CHW Shift!]
 -> Normalized:     torch.Size([3, 518, 518]) (C, H, W)

